{"id":"110f8c4eb1df30c7","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-free-variable.md","title":"Free Variable","display":"df-free-variable — Free Variable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-free-variable","aliases":["92-df-free-variable"],"display":"df-free-variable — Free Variable","depends_on":["[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]"],"source":"第 II 章 pp. 15–16（PDF 32–33）","source_status":"原书自由出现概念的本地实现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-free-variable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-free-variable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-free-variable — Free Variable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 pp. 15–16（PDF 32–33）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书自由出现概念的本地实现"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> (variable symbol, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> (free-variable function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Free}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Free}_G\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable} \\vdash \\mathrm{Free}_G(x,\\varphi) \\leftrightarrow x\\in\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable} \\vdash \\mathrm{Free}_G(x,\\varphi) \\leftrightarrow x\\in\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>自由变元：不被量词约束的变元</li>\n<li>例：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x)\">\\(\\varphi(x)\\)</span>中自由</li>\n<li>例：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\; \\varphi(x)\">\\(\\forall x\\; \\varphi(x)\\)</span>中不自由（被约束）</li>\n<li>无捕获代换只替换目标变量的自由出现；处在同名量词作用域内的约束出现保持不变</li>\n<li>用于定义代入操作</li>\n<li>公式的&quot;参数&quot;是自由变元</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>本文是自由变量集合的成员谓词。原书 L5 的条件应对全部出现集检查，不能把本谓词的否定直接当作原书的“不出现”。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G$ (variable symbol, see [[92-df-signature]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (formula, see [[92-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FV}_G$ (free-variable function, see [[92-df-free-variable-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Free}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable} \\vdash \\mathrm{Free}_G(x,\\varphi) \\leftrightarrow x\\in\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(x)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\; \\varphi(x)","display":false}],"bytes":1362,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-free-variable]]"}],"outgoing":["5a1bd470754681a7","d666a3e3ee6c8148","b9e3d57e94ce36b7"]}